 local_dev_user fallback is gated behind TURTLE_DEV_ANON=1 (Phase 2d).
 - apps/turtle_server.py — add a GET route at / that checks for the turtle_uid cookie. Cookie present → serve web/index.html (chat). Missing → serve web/onboarding.html.
